            <title>[LU-9195] Improve flock locks reconstruct/recovery lgic</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-9195</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;As is discussed in comments in &lt;a href="https://review.whamcloud.com/#/c/24716/8" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://review.whamcloud.com/#/c/24716/8&lt;/a&gt; at patchset 7 and 8 (and more) there are some problems with flock locks recovery in the fact of server death and some parallel packet loss.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;We need to ensure lock chains reconstruction works correctly for flocks.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
